---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base title="AI Disclosure" description="How HazirMinds AI assistants work: they say they are AI up front, never claim to be human, announce recording, offer a person, and text only with consent.">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) clamp(24px,4vw,48px) clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><span aria-current="page" style="color:#585E5A">AI Disclosure</span></nav>
<header style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:clamp(40px,6vw,64px)">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">Legal</p>
<h1 style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">How we use AI</h1>
<p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;text-wrap:pretty">HazirMinds builds AI assistants for businesses and organizations, and uses one on this website. Every assistant we run follows the same rules.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#585E5A"><span>Last updated: Oct 12, 2026</span></div>
</header>
<div style="display:flex;gap:clamp(40px,6vw,96px);align-items:flex-start">
<aside class="hide-lt960" style="flex:0 0 260px;position:sticky;top:104px;max-height:calc(100vh - 128px);overflow-y:auto"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A;padding:0 12px 8px">On this page</p>
<a class="x1" href="#a1" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">It says it's an AI</a>
<a class="x2" href="#a2" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">You can reach a person</a>
<a class="x3" href="#a3" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">Calls may be recorded</a>
<a class="x4" href="#a4" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">Sensitive questions</a>
<a class="x5" href="#a5" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">Texts and consent</a>
<a class="x6" href="#a6" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">Our website assistant</a>
<a class="x7" href="#a7" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">Our clients' assistants</a>
</nav></aside>
<article style="flex:1;min-width:0;max-width:760px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:48px">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:12px;background:#E3EDE9"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">record_voice_over</span><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;color:#0B3A35">Our AI always says it's an AI, and you can always reach a person.</p></div>
<section id="a1" aria-labelledby="a1-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="a1-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">It says it's an AI, up front</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">The first thing a caller hears or a visitor reads says they're talking with an AI assistant. If someone asks whether they're talking to a real person, the assistant answers honestly and offers a person. It never claims to be human.</p>
</section>

<section id="a2" aria-labelledby="a2-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="a2-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">You can always reach a person</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Every assistant offers a way to reach a team member or leave a message.</p>
</section>

<section id="a3" aria-labelledby="a3-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="a3-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Calls may be recorded</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Before a conversation starts, callers hear that the call may be recorded and transcribed.</p>
</section>

<section id="a4" aria-labelledby="a4-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="a4-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Sensitive questions go to a person</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Legal, medical, financial and religious questions are passed to a person the business chooses. The AI doesn't answer them. At masjids and Islamic centers, religious questions go to the imam or scholar the masjid names.</p>
</section>

<section id="a5" aria-labelledby="a5-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="a5-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Texts only with your consent</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">We text only people who have agreed to receive messages, through wording that explains what the messages are for. Message frequency varies, and message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help. A phone call on its own doesn't count as consent to marketing texts.</p>
</section>

<section id="a6" aria-labelledby="a6-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="a6-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">The assistant on this website</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Our website assistant is an AI, not a person. It answers from information we've approved, but it can make mistakes, so please confirm important details with us. Its answers are general information, not a quote or commitment. Please don't share sensitive personal information with it.</p>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Conversations are processed by our AI model providers under terms that don't allow them to use the content to train their models. <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></p>
</section>

<section id="a7" aria-labelledby="a7-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="a7-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">When you talk with one of our clients</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">When you call, text or chat with a business that uses HazirMinds, that business decides how your information is used, and its own privacy policy applies. We process that information only on its behalf, under a written agreement.</p>
</section>

<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding-top:32px;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:15px">Other legal pages</p><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 24px;font-size:16px"><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms">Terms of Use</a><a href="/accessibility">Accessibility Statement</a><a href="/free-website-terms">Free Static Website Terms</a></div></div>
</article>
</div>
</div>

</Base>

<style>
.x1:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x2:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x3:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x4:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x5:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x6:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x7:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
</style>
